  "goodToKnow": "Antik means ancient, especially relating to Greece and Rome: das antike Rom, die antike Philosophie. Die Antike is classical antiquity. It also means antique: antike Möbel. Antique items are Antiquitäten, sold in an Antiquitätenladen; an Antiquariat sells second-hand and rare books. Germany has many antike remains from Roman times, especially in Trier, the oldest city in Germany, with its Porta Nigra gate."
